WEBVTT

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:36.930 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.920 line:0%
[Episode 7]

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:44.220 line:0%
I've been practicing pipa for two hours.

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.950 line:0%
It's more tiring than examining corpses all day.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.200 line:0%
Xiaoqin,

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:49.800 line:0%
go get me some preserved fruit.

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.480 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.140 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.120 line:0%
What are you doing here?

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.450 line:0%
This is Shen's Mansion.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:05.760 line:0%
It's normal that I show up anywhere

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:06.800 line:0%
in this mansion.

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:07.800 line:0%
But I think you

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.620 line:0%
have really taken yourself as Mrs. Shen,

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.320 line:0%
bossing my servant around late at night,

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:13.640 line:0%
eating preserved fruit from the kitchen,

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:16.300 line:0%
and disturbing everyone with that awful sound.

00:03:17.879 --> 00:03:18.760 line:0%
Sorry.

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:19.879 line:0%
The preserved fruit

00:03:19.879 --> 00:03:21.940 line:0%
was bought by myself from West Street.

00:03:21.940 --> 00:03:23.540 line:0%
Next time, I'll get it myself

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:25.460 line:0%
and won't trouble your servants.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.000 line:0%
As for the awful sound you mentioned,

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.000 line:0%
to make it not awful as soon as possible,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.400 line:0%
I have no choice but to practice all night

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:32.720 line:0%
to make it sound pleasant.

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.400 line:0%
Please put up with it.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.960 line:0%
Singing and dancing require natural talent.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:38.400 line:0%
Cramming at the last minute

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.080 line:0%
will only make you a laughingstock.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.080 line:0%
I advise you to give up the idea

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.080 line:0%
of pretending to be a courtesan as soon as possible.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.520 line:0%
What if I succeed?

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:46.200 line:0%
Even if you do, it won't solve the case.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.200 line:0%
Don't forget

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:49.200 line:0%
the killer targets a man and a woman.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:50.879 line:0%
You alone are not enough.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.800 line:0%
There still needs to be a man

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.760 line:0%
entangled with the courtesan.

00:03:57.760 --> 00:03:58.900 line:0%
Well,

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.210 line:0%
I do have someone in mind.

00:04:02.480 --> 00:04:03.520 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.320 line:0%
you just need to invite him over.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:15.960 line:0%
Well... I...

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.000 line:0%
Director Wu,

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:19.840 line:0%
today, please

00:04:20.009 --> 00:04:21.240 line:0%
accompany my wife

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.240 line:0%
to celebrate the Kaiyang Festival.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.160 line:0%
My wife said her lover

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.400 line:0%
has to be you.

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.970 line:0%
Grand Commander, you've misunderstood me.

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:35.700 line:0%
I'm innocent.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:37.420 line:0%
If... If you don't believe me,

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.290 line:0%
go ask around in the Ministry of Justice.

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:41.800 line:0%
Far from being lovers with your wife,

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:43.959 line:0%
we are like fire and water.

00:04:43.959 --> 00:04:44.620 line:0%
We can't even sit on the same mat.

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.120 line:0%
We're utterly incompatible.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.720 line:0%
-I…
-You are too nervous.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.090 line:0%
Today,

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:51.920 line:0%
my wife will just pretend

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.840 line:0%
to be your beautiful mistress.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:54.640 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.920 line:0%
what are you...

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.120 line:0%
doing this for?

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:03.650 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:05.680 line:0%
Stop dragging me. Grand Commander!

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.010 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.120 line:0%
Why me?

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:28.560 line:0%
Because your mistress

00:05:28.560 --> 00:05:30.280 line:0%
is of unparalleled beauty,

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.090 line:0%
renowned among the noble ladies in Imperial City.

00:05:32.090 --> 00:05:32.730 line:0%
You...

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.800 line:0%
Let... Let go!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:35.860 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:37.720 line:0%
It's rare to see Madam all dressed up.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:38.940 line:0%
She's quite charming.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.800 line:0%
Instead of wasting time flattering here,

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.730 line:0%
why don't you do something useful?

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:43.600 line:0%
Yes.

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:44.920 line:0%
Come with me.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:57.600 line:0%
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:03.040 line:0%
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:06.780 line:0%
On the Day of Kaiyang,

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.520 line:0%
the grand empress dowager will tour the streets.

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:10.150 line:0%
I need to protect her by her side.

00:06:10.150 --> 00:06:12.080 line:0%
You must keep a close eye on my wife.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:13.610 line:0%
If the suspect makes a move,

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:15.010 line:0%
arrest him immediately.

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:17.160 line:0%
If anything happens to her,

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:18.930 line:0%
you'll be held responsible.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:28.210 line:0%
Long live the emperor!

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.400 line:0%
Long live

00:06:30.440 --> 00:06:34.060 line:0%
the grand empress dowager!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:38.720 line:0%
Bravo!

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:42.840 line:0%
What a wonderful performance!

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:43.830 line:0%
I wonder

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.520 line:0%
if there is any other talented individual

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:48.280 line:0%
willing to perform on stage.

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:57.959 line:0%
Everyone,

00:06:58.240 --> 00:06:59.560 line:0%
my beloved concubine

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.600 line:0%
would like to perform a pipa song

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.480 line:0%
for you all.

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:06.910 line:0%
-Great!
-Great!

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:08.420 line:0%
Wu Taiming

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.120 line:0%
has actually brought the mistress he keeps

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:11.440 line:0%
here in public.

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:13.360 line:0%
He actually dared to call that courtesan

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:15.320 line:0%
who hasn't married him his concubine.

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:18.350 line:0%
This really embarrasses Mrs. Wu.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:25.350 line:0%
Long live the emperor!

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.360 line:0%
Long live

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:31.060 line:0%
the grand empress dowager!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.120 line:0%
Greetings,

00:07:36.120 --> 00:07:37.800 line:0%
Your Majesties.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.240 line:0%
You have graced West Street

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.560 line:0%
with your presence

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.410 line:0%
to tour and pray for blessings.

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.480 line:0%
May Heaven bestow auspicious signs

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:48.360 line:0%
to signify Cang State's flourishing fortune.

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.160 line:0%
May the weather be favorable and harvests bountiful!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:53.020 line:0%
May the state be prosperous and the people at peace!

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.120 line:0%
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:39.219 line:0%
Not bad!

00:09:21.050 --> 00:09:22.680 line:0%
Look, it's a colorful phoenix!

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:24.040 line:0%
It's a colorful phoenix!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.300 line:0%
-It's so beautiful!
-It's a divine bird!

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:55.960 line:0%
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

00:10:07.130 --> 00:10:08.620 line:0%
This is God's will.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.240 line:0%
Heaven has bestowed an auspicious sign

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:18.220 line:0%
to bless Cang State!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:28.130 line:0%
What is this fragrance?

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:29.460 line:0%
It's so strange.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:09.030 line:0%
A thousand butterflies dance in the spring stars, their sleeves fluttering;

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:11.480 line:0%
nine-branched lanterns ignite the night, and the bells ring.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:14.160 line:0%
-What a splendid couplet!
-Bravo!

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:50.240 line:0%
Madam?

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:51.960 line:0%
Madam?

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:53.160 line:0%
Jing Lin!

00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:53.880 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:11:53.880 --> 00:11:55.040 line:0%
Wu Taiming and Madam both are missing!

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:55.760 line:0%
Come on!

00:12:08.520 --> 00:12:09.320 line:0%
Tell me.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.600 line:0%
Who is the mastermind of the murder case?

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:12.450 line:0%
Murder?

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:13.520 line:0%
What murder?

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:15.960 line:0%
Where is Madam?

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.320 line:0%
Please spare my life.

00:12:19.050 --> 00:12:21.110 line:0%
Grand Commander, please show mercy!

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:25.800 line:0%
This is a family matter of mine.

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.000 line:0%
My brother-in-law cheated on my sister.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.080 line:0%
I came to teach him a lesson.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.680 line:0%
Does that also make me guilty?

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:30.980 line:0%
Most of those paired corpses

00:12:30.980 --> 00:12:32.800 line:0%
were acquainted when they were alive,

00:12:32.800 --> 00:12:34.240 line:0%
often seen together in pairs.

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.240 line:0%
However, two pairs

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:35.960 line:0%
were found to have no connections

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.590 line:0%
when they were alive.

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:38.960 line:0%
Oh no!

00:12:44.920 --> 00:12:46.090 line:0%
I am Shen Du.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.080 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.740 line:0%
Brother Shen Du!

00:12:49.160 --> 00:12:51.360 line:0%
Brother Shen Du, do you still remember me?

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.820 line:0%
Of course I remember you.

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:53.800 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.680 line:0%
I won't forget you.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:58.760 line:0%
None of this is real.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.440 line:0%
Should I know you?

00:13:02.280 --> 00:13:03.280 line:0%
Don't expect to become

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.720 line:0%
the true Mrs. Shen.

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:06.880 line:0%
You're not someone

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:08.600 line:0%
I willingly married.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.960 line:0%
Don't expect to survive in Shen's Mansion.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.380 line:0%
What is this place?

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:32.820 line:0%
You don't need to know.

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:36.800 line:0%
Why did you kill so many people?

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:38.080 line:0%
You don't need to know.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:43.280 line:0%
Why are you so full

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.200 line:0%
of crap?

00:13:45.480 --> 00:13:46.480 line:0%
Looks like today,

00:13:46.480 --> 00:13:48.520 line:0%
I won't be able to escape.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.500 line:0%
Why don't you remove your veil

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:52.350 line:0%
and let me see your face?

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.820 line:0%
Everyone knows that you, Yan Xing,

00:13:57.840 --> 00:13:59.040 line:0%
is very smart.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:13:59.680 line:0%
If I let you

00:13:59.680 --> 00:14:00.920 line:0%
see my face,

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:01.840 line:0%
after you

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:11.450 line:0%
die and become a ghost,

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.340 line:0%
you might appear in your husband's dreams.

00:14:13.340 --> 00:14:14.680 line:0%
What should I do then?

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:18.500 line:0%
You've killed so many people.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.240 line:0%
Their resentment

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:21.200 line:0%
has already turned

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:22.320 line:0%
into vengeful spirits around you,

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:24.120 line:0%
accompanying you day and night.

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:25.880 line:0%
Can't you see them?

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:27.520 line:0%
They mean nothing to me.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.170 line:0%
All of them deserved to die.

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:34.840 line:0%
Even if they've become ghosts,

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:35.960 line:0%
they still wouldn't dare to appear

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:36.840 line:0%
before me!

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:38.380 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:39.520 line:0%
I'll make them die again!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.520 line:0%
Am I also someone who deserves to die?

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.000 line:0%
Those people you mentioned

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.360 line:0%
had something in common,

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.420 line:0%
and you believe they deserved to die.

00:14:46.580 --> 00:14:48.080 line:0%
In your eyes,

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:50.180 line:0%
am I also someone who deserves to die?

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.160 line:0%
You've asked so many questions.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.090 line:0%
You'll have to die, just like them.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:14.570 line:0%
It's just that

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:18.960 line:0%
I still need to wait

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:20.390 line:0%
a little longer

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:21.560 line:0%
before I kill you.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.240 line:0%
What are you waiting for?

00:15:24.240 --> 00:15:24.880 line:0%
I'm waiting

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:27.080 line:0%
for the blood in your body to coagulate.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.250 line:0%
So when I cut out your heart,

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:30.880 line:0%
you won't even bleed.

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:36.460 line:0%
I am the wife of the grand commander.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.640 line:0%
If you dare to kill me,

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.680 line:0%
when they find you later,

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.760 line:0%
they will surely skin you alive.

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:47.080 line:0%
Even if I don't kill you,

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.160 line:0%
when Shen Du catches me,

00:15:48.160 --> 00:15:49.680 line:0%
he won't spare me either.

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:51.360 line:0%
I'll die no matter what,

00:15:57.960 --> 00:15:58.960 line:0%
so I

00:15:59.350 --> 00:16:00.330 line:0%
might as well

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.120 line:0%
take you with me.

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:03.860 line:0%
I can help you plead for mercy.

00:16:04.240 --> 00:16:06.240 line:0%
He'll let you have an intact corpse.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.590 line:0%
Our marital relationship is very good.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:11.120 line:0%
Everyone in Xiang'an City knows it.

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:12.480 line:0%
He will listen to me.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.360 line:0%
He will listen to me.

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.430 line:0%
He will listen to me.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:20.920 line:0%
He will listen to me!

00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:22.470 line:0%
Shut up!

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:24.760 line:0%
Shut up!

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.920 line:0%
You shameless slut!

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.240 line:0%
He won't listen to you!

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.040 line:0%
He's mine!

00:16:29.040 --> 00:16:30.930 line:0%
Mine! Mine!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.600 line:0%
Stop!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.250 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:44.660 line:0%
Xing.

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:48.990 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:51.800 line:0%
Xing.

00:17:07.050 --> 00:17:08.850 line:0%
Thank you for showing up in time.

00:17:17.260 --> 00:17:18.440 line:0%
Fortunately, you sprinkled bean flour

00:17:18.440 --> 00:17:19.369 line:0%
on your clothes.

00:17:20.240 --> 00:17:23.169 line:0%
The fighting dogs followed the scent and led us here.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:33.150 line:0%
How are you feeling?

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:37.210 line:0%
I... I'm fine.

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:39.600 line:0%
I just...

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.160 line:0%
Have you caught the murderer?

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:00.760 line:0%
I just...

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:03.950 line:0%
had a dream.

00:18:05.640 --> 00:18:06.440 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.440 line:0%
Remove her veil.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:22.960 line:0%
It's you.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:32.800 line:0%
Xing!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:39.240 line:0%
Take her to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:39.880 line:0%
Yes.

00:18:40.480 --> 00:18:41.280 line:0%
Take her away.

00:18:41.560 --> 00:18:42.080 line:0%
Yes.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.000 line:0%
Xing.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:07.440 line:0%
You're awake.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:09.320 line:0%
Chuichui.

00:19:10.780 --> 00:19:12.310 line:0%
How long have I been asleep?

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:15.700 line:0%
Where is Mrs. Tang?

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:17.240 line:0%
Has she been interrogated?

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.320 line:0%
You've only been asleep for two hours.

00:19:19.320 --> 00:19:20.160 line:0%
Why are you asking about that

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.440 line:0%
the moment you woke up?

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.560 line:0%
No wonder Shen Du told me

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:25.960 line:0%
to keep a close eye on you.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:27.930 line:0%
What's the result?

00:19:29.760 --> 00:19:32.680 line:0%
Of course she's being stubborn and refuses to confess.

00:19:32.680 --> 00:19:33.560 line:0%
But

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:36.240 line:0%
the grand empress dowager has come to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:19:36.240 --> 00:19:38.370 line:0%
She wants to interrogate her herself.

00:19:38.920 --> 00:19:41.400 line:0%
Let's see if she can escape justice this time.

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.530 line:0%
I'm going there now.

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.440 line:0%
Don't.

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.960 line:0%
The effects of the medicine haven't even worn off yet.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:51.880 line:0%
I've been investigating this murderer for a long time.

00:19:51.880 --> 00:19:53.720 line:0%
I know how to make her talk.

00:19:53.840 --> 00:19:54.640 line:0%
No.

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.440 line:0%
You almost lost your life today.

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.710 line:0%
The world won't end without you.

00:20:02.480 --> 00:20:03.440 line:0%
Besides,

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:04.760 line:0%
Shen Du told me to keep a close eye on you.

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:05.400 line:0%
Are you my friend

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:06.840 line:0%
or his friend?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:08.840 line:0%
Chuichui,

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.160 line:0%
you know me.

00:20:10.330 --> 00:20:11.520 line:0%
Once I make up my mind,

00:20:11.520 --> 00:20:12.600 line:0%
no one can stop me.

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.640 line:0%
Right now, there's something

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.200 line:0%
I need your help with.

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.750 line:0%
I never expected that the one

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:28.970 line:0%
who committed such a heinous crime

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:31.240 line:0%
is the widow of Tang Chengyi,

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.680 line:0%
a loyal official.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:37.440 line:0%
Why did you do that?

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.090 line:0%
I remember

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:52.600 line:0%
you and Mrs. Tang

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:53.960 line:0%
are quite close.

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:55.870 line:0%
Now,

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:59.360 line:0%
she is the suspect in this murder case.

00:21:00.240 --> 00:21:01.200 line:0%
Princess Ying,

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.950 line:0%
did you know anything about it?

00:21:05.600 --> 00:21:06.800 line:0%
Mother, please investigate clearly.

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.070 line:0%
Although I have had dealings

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.070 line:0%
with Mrs. Tang,

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.720 line:0%
I truly knew nothing

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.400 line:0%
about her murders.

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:13.320 line:0%
If I had known

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:14.560 line:0%
she is a murderer,

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:16.760 line:0%
I would never have associated with her.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:30.610 line:0%
I want to ask you

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:32.800 line:0%
why you killed

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:35.080 line:0%
so many innocent people.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.680 line:0%
I didn't kill any innocent people.

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:38.210 line:0%
Cang State has its own laws.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:39.480 line:0%
Who are you

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.290 line:0%
to define innocence?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:52.090 line:0%
I am Yan Xing, a scribe from the Ministry of Justice.

00:21:52.090 --> 00:21:54.030 line:0%
I may have been abrupt in my haste.

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:55.980 line:0%
Your Majesty, please forgive me.

00:22:01.760 --> 00:22:03.160 line:0%
I've failed to manage my household strictly,

00:22:03.160 --> 00:22:04.560 line:0%
causing disturbance to you, Your Majesty.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.040 line:0%
Please punish me.

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:07.320 line:0%
It's alright.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:11.320 line:0%
I heard Mrs. Shen is very good

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:13.400 line:0%
at reasoning and solving cases.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.610 line:0%
Now Meng Ceran

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:17.480 line:0%
refuses to confess.

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:19.560 line:0%
Do you have any insights?

00:22:25.640 --> 00:22:27.000 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:22:27.840 --> 00:22:29.080 line:0%
the men

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:30.240 line:0%
killed by Mrs. Tang

00:22:30.240 --> 00:22:31.480 line:0%
were all betrothed,

00:22:31.760 --> 00:22:33.680 line:0%
yet they frequented brothels

00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:35.160 line:0%
and were infatuated with courtesans.

00:22:35.160 --> 00:22:36.120 line:0%
The women she killed

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:37.780 line:0%
all had similar appearances,

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:39.480 line:0%
with a towering hairstyle.

00:22:39.480 --> 00:22:40.240 line:0%
Also,

00:22:40.240 --> 00:22:41.800 line:0%
they were all courtesans good at playing pipa.

00:22:41.800 --> 00:22:42.520 line:0%
Shut up!

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:43.440 line:0%
Who would believe

00:22:43.440 --> 00:22:44.520 line:0%
such nonsense?

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:45.760 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:47.470 line:0%
all the discovered bodies

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:48.880 line:0%
were treated with cinnabar

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:50.250 line:0%
to delay decomposition,

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:50.920 line:0%
causing

00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:52.600 line:0%
the coroner's estimated time of death

00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:53.600 line:0%
to be inaccurate.

00:22:53.600 --> 00:22:54.760 line:0%
Later, we deduced

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:56.080 line:0%
the correct dates of death

00:22:56.080 --> 00:22:57.080 line:0%
and found

00:22:57.200 --> 00:22:59.000 line:0%
they all died on the Day of Kaiyang

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:01.800 line:0%
calculated by the Imperial Astronomer's Office.

00:23:06.960 --> 00:23:08.000 line:0%
Mrs. Tang,

00:23:08.960 --> 00:23:10.480 line:0%
did you do all that

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:11.840 line:0%
really just for

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:13.640 line:0%
a moment of satisfaction?

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:15.440 line:0%
At first,

00:23:15.600 --> 00:23:16.960 line:0%
I guessed that your crimes

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:17.720 line:0%
were based on

00:23:17.720 --> 00:23:19.120 line:0%
common facial features.

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.550 line:0%
Later, I realized

00:23:21.680 --> 00:23:23.040 line:0%
it was more

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:24.080 line:0%
because of

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:26.120 line:0%
your deep obsession with the identity.

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:27.130 line:0%
I guess

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:29.080 line:0%
the women you killed

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:30.880 line:0%
were related to someone

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.520 line:0%
very close to you.

00:23:32.520 --> 00:23:33.790 line:0%
Shut your mouth!

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:35.760 line:0%
Have you been traumatized,

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:36.760 line:0%
or perhaps

00:23:36.780 --> 00:23:38.120 line:0%
had some emotional entanglement

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:40.080 line:0%
with some men from a pleasure house?

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:42.610 line:0%
And it happened exactly on the Day of Kaiyang.

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:49.520 line:0%
Nonsense!

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:51.640 line:0%
He who has a mind to beat his dog

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:53.170 line:0%
will easily find his stick!

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:54.680 line:0%
Right,

00:23:55.370 --> 00:23:56.480 line:0%
a few days ago,

00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.320 line:0%
Honey, you caught a cold at night.

00:23:58.320 --> 00:23:59.480 line:0%
The weather has been getting colder lately.

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:01.880 line:0%
You should take care of your health, Honey.

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:08.160 line:0%
I'm much better now.

00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:09.800 line:0%
Honey, if you

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:11.700 line:0%
can care more about me,

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.160 line:0%
I won't catch a cold in the future.

00:24:16.500 --> 00:24:17.360 line:0%
But you

00:24:17.840 --> 00:24:19.140 line:0%
just suffered a fright.

00:24:19.140 --> 00:24:21.000 line:0%
Why aren't you resting properly?

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:23.520 line:0%
I'm just...

00:24:25.280 --> 00:24:26.640 line:0%
worried about you.

00:24:27.930 --> 00:24:28.880 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen,

00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:31.400 line:0%
you really treat the Imperial Security Bureau as your home.

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:33.200 line:0%
And Mrs. Shen, you've even considered this place

00:24:33.200 --> 00:24:34.960 line:0%
as your own bedroom.

00:24:36.390 --> 00:24:38.950 line:0%
I'm pleased to see such deep affection

00:24:39.240 --> 00:24:41.100 line:0%
between you two.

00:24:42.050 --> 00:24:44.180 line:0%
But Mrs. Shen,

00:24:44.640 --> 00:24:46.520 line:0%
the case is important.

00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:49.400 line:0%
You must handle it with discretion.

00:24:49.700 --> 00:24:51.520 line:0%
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:24:59.560 --> 00:25:02.560 line:0%
Constable Marshal Xu Xiangren requests an audience.

00:25:10.810 --> 00:25:12.370 line:0%
I'm Xu Xiangren, Constable Marshal.

00:25:12.370 --> 00:25:13.830 line:0%
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:25:15.960 --> 00:25:16.760 line:0%
Xing.

00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:20.080 line:0%
I'll take my leave.

00:25:25.680 --> 00:25:26.440 line:0%
Actually,

00:25:26.440 --> 00:25:27.400 line:0%
the constables

00:25:27.400 --> 00:25:30.260 line:0%
unearthed another pair of male and female corpses.

00:25:31.680 --> 00:25:32.520 line:0%
This is a portrait I drew

00:25:32.520 --> 00:25:33.880 line:0%
to reconstruct the facial features

00:25:33.880 --> 00:25:35.160 line:0%
of the male victim.

00:25:43.370 --> 00:25:44.600 line:0%
Give it to me.

00:25:44.940 --> 00:25:46.080 line:0%
Give it to me!

00:25:47.480 --> 00:25:48.940 line:0%
Give him to me!

00:25:54.600 --> 00:25:55.640 line:0%
Just as I thought.

00:25:57.390 --> 00:25:58.730 line:0%
In your heart,

00:25:58.960 --> 00:26:00.690 line:0%
you're the real victim, right?

00:26:00.700 --> 00:26:02.010 line:0%
What do you know?

00:26:09.370 --> 00:26:11.140 line:0%
This isn't my fault.

00:26:11.730 --> 00:26:13.980 line:0%
They betrayed me first.

00:26:14.230 --> 00:26:15.720 line:0%
It was them!

00:26:17.010 --> 00:26:19.440 line:0%
It's all their fault!

00:26:21.390 --> 00:26:23.480 line:0%
I was so good to him.

00:26:23.500 --> 00:26:26.190 line:0%
Why did he betray me?

00:26:27.960 --> 00:26:29.500 line:0%
Is the man you mentioned

00:26:30.400 --> 00:26:32.040 line:0%
the person in the portrait,

00:26:32.350 --> 00:26:33.910 line:0%
your first husband?

00:26:35.010 --> 00:26:36.490 line:0%
Yes.

00:26:48.330 --> 00:26:49.640 line:0%
In childhood,

00:26:51.460 --> 00:26:54.120 line:0%
my younger sister was abducted.

00:26:55.520 --> 00:26:57.520 line:0%
When we met again,

00:26:57.820 --> 00:26:59.500 line:0%
she had already become

00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:03.230 line:0%
a courtesan playing pipa.

00:27:04.130 --> 00:27:05.360 line:0%
At that time,

00:27:05.530 --> 00:27:07.460 line:0%
I was already married.

00:27:08.560 --> 00:27:10.560 line:0%
But I never expected

00:27:10.810 --> 00:27:12.820 line:0%
that on the Day of Kaiyang...

00:27:15.680 --> 00:27:18.580 line:0%
On the Day of Kaiyang, I found

00:27:18.640 --> 00:27:21.040 line:0%
she had an affair with my husband.

00:27:21.540 --> 00:27:23.460 line:0%
They were the two people

00:27:23.480 --> 00:27:25.570 line:0%
I loved and trusted the most.

00:27:25.590 --> 00:27:28.220 line:0%
But they both betrayed me.

00:27:28.570 --> 00:27:30.290 line:0%
To preserve dignity,

00:27:30.310 --> 00:27:32.780 line:0%
I gave her a cup of poisoned wine.

00:27:32.800 --> 00:27:34.400 line:0%
But unexpectedly,

00:27:34.400 --> 00:27:35.400 line:0%
my husband

00:27:35.420 --> 00:27:38.980 line:0%
drank that cup of wine instead.

00:27:39.730 --> 00:27:40.690 line:0%
No!

00:27:44.360 --> 00:27:46.440 line:0%
After my husband died,

00:27:46.720 --> 00:27:48.580 line:0%
my sister disappeared as well.

00:27:48.770 --> 00:27:52.180 line:0%
I looked for her for a very long time.

00:27:54.280 --> 00:27:55.280 line:0%
In the end,

00:27:55.300 --> 00:27:57.860 line:0%
I found her in the tomb.

00:28:02.170 --> 00:28:03.780 line:0%
The two of them...

00:28:04.320 --> 00:28:05.080 line:0%
The two of them

00:28:05.080 --> 00:28:07.490 line:0%
were holding each other tightly!

00:28:17.760 --> 00:28:18.560 line:0%
No.

00:28:20.980 --> 00:28:22.100 line:0%
It's not like that.

00:28:23.040 --> 00:28:24.100 line:0%
It's not like that.

00:28:25.770 --> 00:28:27.060 line:0%
It's not like that!

00:28:27.200 --> 00:28:28.400 line:0%
It's not like that!

00:28:28.480 --> 00:28:29.800 line:0%
That lowly woman

00:28:29.800 --> 00:28:32.810 line:0%
was not my sister!

00:28:33.520 --> 00:28:34.990 line:0%
She was just...

00:28:35.040 --> 00:28:37.000 line:0%
She was just a courtesan who seduced

00:28:37.000 --> 00:28:39.520 line:0%
my husband!

00:28:40.560 --> 00:28:41.800 line:0%
She deserved to die!

00:28:41.840 --> 00:28:43.400 line:0%
Instead of being a decent woman,

00:28:43.400 --> 00:28:44.040 line:0%
she seduced

00:28:44.040 --> 00:28:45.480 line:0%
someone else's husband!

00:28:45.680 --> 00:28:47.320 line:0%
She deserved to be torn into pieces!

00:28:47.320 --> 00:28:49.200 line:0%
She deserved to be skinned!

00:28:49.280 --> 00:28:51.480 line:0%
She deserved to be insulted by everyone

00:28:51.480 --> 00:28:53.580 line:0%
and be mocked by the whole world!

00:28:53.740 --> 00:28:54.920 line:0%
So you killed

00:28:54.920 --> 00:28:56.640 line:0%
those women who were

00:28:56.760 --> 00:28:57.960 line:0%
like your sister!

00:29:00.550 --> 00:29:03.610 line:0%
[Bijiang Gold Shop]

00:29:04.400 --> 00:29:05.350 line:0%
Do I look good?

00:29:07.640 --> 00:29:08.440 line:0%
Yes.

00:29:11.760 --> 00:29:13.040 line:0%
They deserved to die.

00:29:13.080 --> 00:29:14.560 line:0%
And those disgusting men,

00:29:15.600 --> 00:29:17.780 line:0%
why were they so obsessed with those

00:29:17.880 --> 00:29:19.460 line:0%
courtesans?

00:29:20.320 --> 00:29:21.680 line:0%
In this world,

00:29:22.070 --> 00:29:23.040 line:0%
not everyone

00:29:23.040 --> 00:29:25.170 line:0%
has the right to choose their own life.

00:29:25.350 --> 00:29:26.480 line:0%
Many of them were born

00:29:26.480 --> 00:29:27.840 line:0%
in pleasure houses.

00:29:27.880 --> 00:29:29.280 line:0%
They have no choice but to

00:29:29.320 --> 00:29:31.120 line:0%
serve others with their beauty.

00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:32.320 line:0%
Moreover,

00:29:32.360 --> 00:29:33.080 line:0%
that is not a reason

00:29:33.080 --> 00:29:34.810 line:0%
for you to take someone's life!

00:29:40.680 --> 00:29:42.120 line:0%
Actually, at first,

00:29:44.680 --> 00:29:46.750 line:0%
I blamed myself too.

00:29:47.750 --> 00:29:49.450 line:0%
If it weren't for me,

00:29:50.010 --> 00:29:51.670 line:0%
my sister wouldn't have died.

00:29:53.100 --> 00:29:55.230 line:0%
My husband wouldn't have died either.

00:29:55.910 --> 00:29:56.840 line:0%
If it weren't for

00:29:56.840 --> 00:29:58.240 line:0%
the mistake I made,

00:29:58.800 --> 00:30:00.300 line:0%
I wouldn't have lost

00:30:00.360 --> 00:30:03.650 line:0%
my two loved ones at the same time.

00:30:04.380 --> 00:30:05.890 line:0%
So you regret it.

00:30:06.570 --> 00:30:08.160 line:0%
You made those bodies

00:30:08.400 --> 00:30:10.210 line:0%
hold each other

00:30:10.470 --> 00:30:11.960 line:0%
to grant their wishes.

00:30:12.200 --> 00:30:13.280 line:0%
Mrs. Shen,

00:30:15.090 --> 00:30:16.610 line:0%
you're indeed clever.

00:30:17.830 --> 00:30:19.490 line:0%
You've seen right through it.

00:30:20.380 --> 00:30:21.660 line:0%
But do you think

00:30:22.210 --> 00:30:25.170 line:0%
with your cleverness,

00:30:26.220 --> 00:30:27.040 line:0%
you can

00:30:27.040 --> 00:30:29.080 line:0%
forever win a man's heart?

00:30:42.120 --> 00:30:42.880 line:0%
Do you think he will

00:30:42.880 --> 00:30:44.550 line:0%
always protect you like this?

00:30:44.720 --> 00:30:46.190 line:0%
He said he loves you,

00:30:46.210 --> 00:30:48.280 line:0%
but the one he loves is himself!

00:30:48.600 --> 00:30:50.280 line:0%
He will definitely deceive you!

00:30:50.280 --> 00:30:51.000 line:0%
He will surely

00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:52.240 line:0%
break your heart and leave you

00:30:52.240 --> 00:30:53.740 line:0%
in unbearable pain!

00:30:53.800 --> 00:30:55.520 line:0%
What's wrong with loving oneself?

00:30:55.520 --> 00:30:56.560 line:0%
Before loving others, everyone should

00:30:56.560 --> 00:30:57.890 line:0%
love themselves first.

00:31:01.240 --> 00:31:02.260 line:0%
Between husband and wife,

00:31:02.260 --> 00:31:03.240 line:0%
it should never be

00:31:03.240 --> 00:31:04.760 line:0%
one side endlessly taking,

00:31:04.760 --> 00:31:06.440 line:0%
nor one-sided protection.

00:31:06.460 --> 00:31:07.580 line:0%
A couple should

00:31:07.610 --> 00:31:08.920 line:0%
weather storms together

00:31:08.920 --> 00:31:10.200 line:0%
and face challenges together.

00:31:10.200 --> 00:31:10.760 line:0%
That's what makes a true home,

00:31:10.760 --> 00:31:12.000 line:0%
the way it should be.

00:31:50.120 --> 00:31:51.290 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:31:51.560 --> 00:31:53.600 line:0%
the truth of the case has now come to light,

00:31:53.600 --> 00:31:56.000 line:0%
and the true culprit has confessed and submitted to the law.

00:31:56.000 --> 00:31:58.260 line:0%
As for how Mrs. Tang should be dealt with,

00:31:58.570 --> 00:32:00.240 line:0%
we await your decree.

00:32:01.180 --> 00:32:02.370 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:32:02.840 --> 00:32:04.040 line:0%
in my humble opinion,

00:32:04.080 --> 00:32:06.000 line:0%
the murderer has already lost her mind.

00:32:06.000 --> 00:32:07.000 line:0%
Please don't

00:32:07.000 --> 00:32:08.320 line:0%
dwell on past bonds,

00:32:08.680 --> 00:32:10.810 line:0%
and close the case as soon as possible.

00:32:12.850 --> 00:32:15.780 line:0%
Considering she is the widow of a loyal official,

00:32:16.120 --> 00:32:18.320 line:0%
grant her the dignity of a whole corpse.

00:32:25.200 --> 00:32:26.000 line:0%
Yes.

00:32:43.120 --> 00:32:45.010 line:0%
Moths fly into flames,

00:32:45.460 --> 00:32:48.070 line:0%
born at dawn, dead by dusk!

00:32:48.480 --> 00:32:50.160 line:0%
Beyond the cycle of reincarnation,

00:32:50.160 --> 00:32:53.120 line:0%
untouched by death within it!

00:32:53.680 --> 00:32:54.480 line:0%
Jing Lin!

00:32:54.480 --> 00:32:55.240 line:0%
Extinguish the fire!

00:32:55.240 --> 00:32:56.080 line:0%
Yes!

00:32:59.670 --> 00:33:01.280 line:0%
Isn't that what Chen Huo'e said

00:33:01.280 --> 00:33:02.280 line:0%
before she was executed

00:33:02.280 --> 00:33:03.560 line:0%
five years ago?

00:33:06.670 --> 00:33:08.200 line:0%
Take this mad woman away!

00:33:08.200 --> 00:33:08.920 line:0%
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:33:37.520 --> 00:33:38.320 line:0%
Have you always been

00:33:38.320 --> 00:33:39.980 line:0%
so nosy since you were a child?

00:33:40.770 --> 00:33:42.290 line:0%
It was a matter of life and death.

00:33:42.290 --> 00:33:44.150 line:0%
How could you say I was being nosy?

00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:46.680 line:0%
I know

00:33:46.920 --> 00:33:48.480 line:0%
today, you specially asked Chuichui

00:33:48.480 --> 00:33:49.540 line:0%
to keep an eye on me.

00:33:49.680 --> 00:33:51.360 line:0%
But if I hadn't burst into the hall,

00:33:51.360 --> 00:33:52.640 line:0%
how would Mrs. Tang's case

00:33:52.640 --> 00:33:53.480 line:0%
have been resolved

00:33:53.480 --> 00:33:54.320 line:0%
so easily?

00:33:54.320 --> 00:33:55.120 line:0%
Today, you...

00:34:05.120 --> 00:34:05.920 line:0%
did well.

00:34:10.760 --> 00:34:11.560 line:0%
You...

00:34:12.600 --> 00:34:14.080 line:0%
are not going to scold me?

00:34:15.760 --> 00:34:17.720 line:0%
That so-called new pair of corpses you mentioned —

00:34:17.720 --> 00:34:19.320 line:0%
you made that up, didn't you?

00:34:20.289 --> 00:34:21.950 line:0%
I just asked Xu

00:34:21.950 --> 00:34:23.120 line:0%
to fetch the portrait

00:34:23.120 --> 00:34:24.680 line:0%
of Mrs. Tang's first husband.

00:34:24.680 --> 00:34:27.539 line:0%
It was only to provoke her into revealing the truth.

00:34:28.050 --> 00:34:29.580 line:0%
The truth has come to light.

00:34:31.010 --> 00:34:32.010 line:0%
It's just that...

00:34:33.470 --> 00:34:34.999 line:0%
It's just that in this case,

00:34:36.240 --> 00:34:38.300 line:0%
I think we've overlooked something.

00:34:38.880 --> 00:34:40.740 line:0%
What exactly have we overlooked?

00:34:47.720 --> 00:34:49.720 line:0%
-The human hearts.
-The human hearts.

00:34:49.720 --> 00:34:51.560 line:0%
Mrs. Tang killed so many people,

00:34:51.800 --> 00:34:54.200 line:0%
and the hearts of the victims were removed.

00:34:54.360 --> 00:34:56.240 line:0%
So where are these hearts now?

00:35:16.360 --> 00:35:17.320 line:0%
Mrs. Tang,

00:35:18.000 --> 00:35:20.130 line:0%
I have something important to ask you.

00:35:23.920 --> 00:35:25.080 line:0%
Killing is simple,

00:35:25.680 --> 00:35:26.740 line:0%
but moving bodies,

00:35:26.760 --> 00:35:27.560 line:0%
digging pits,

00:35:27.760 --> 00:35:28.800 line:0%
and reburying them

00:35:28.800 --> 00:35:29.920 line:0%
are not something a woman

00:35:29.920 --> 00:35:31.560 line:0%
can easily accomplish alone.

00:35:31.560 --> 00:35:33.000 line:0%
You must have had help.

00:35:33.020 --> 00:35:34.680 line:0%
Why did you go to such lengths?

00:35:34.920 --> 00:35:36.280 line:0%
What was your purpose?

00:35:37.000 --> 00:35:38.640 line:0%
Moths fly into flames.

00:35:44.220 --> 00:35:46.000 line:0%
Moths fly into flames.

00:35:54.040 --> 00:35:55.170 line:0%
She's lost her mind.

00:35:56.670 --> 00:35:58.600 line:0%
She's the most important witness.

00:36:00.080 --> 00:36:02.280 line:0%
How can she just lose her mind like this?

00:36:06.750 --> 00:36:08.700 line:0%
I will never die.

00:36:09.770 --> 00:36:12.080 line:0%
I will become a moth.

00:36:12.740 --> 00:36:14.670 line:0%
I'll live forever.

00:36:17.810 --> 00:36:18.640 line:0%
Fly away.

00:36:19.160 --> 00:36:20.200 line:0%
Fly away!

00:36:20.760 --> 00:36:22.340 line:0%
You killed so many people.

00:36:22.420 --> 00:36:23.800 line:0%
Where did you put their hearts?

00:36:23.800 --> 00:36:24.760 line:0%
Fly away!

00:36:25.180 --> 00:36:26.550 line:0%
-Meng Ceran!
-Fly away.

00:36:38.910 --> 00:36:41.000 line:0%
Please burn me to death.

00:36:41.680 --> 00:36:42.680 line:0%
Please.

00:36:42.680 --> 00:36:44.200 line:0%
I want to be reborn from the flames.

00:36:44.200 --> 00:36:46.130 line:0%
I want to be reborn from the flames.

00:36:46.160 --> 00:36:47.800 line:0%
Please. I'm begging you!

00:36:47.800 --> 00:36:48.760 line:0%
There's no need to ask her.

00:36:48.760 --> 00:36:50.000 line:0%
She's a mad woman.

00:36:50.020 --> 00:36:51.080 line:0%
Whatever she says

00:36:51.280 --> 00:36:52.560 line:0%
holds no credibility.

00:36:52.580 --> 00:36:54.620 line:0%
Burn me! Just burn me to death!

00:36:54.650 --> 00:36:56.110 line:0%
She will be executed soon.

00:36:57.210 --> 00:36:58.600 line:0%
Burn me to death.

00:36:59.560 --> 00:37:01.870 line:0%
Burn me to death. Come on.

00:37:16.870 --> 00:37:18.470 line:0%
What are you thinking about?

00:37:21.600 --> 00:37:23.660 line:0%
I'm thinking about Mrs. Tang's case.

00:37:24.320 --> 00:37:25.680 line:0%
Her love begot hate,

00:37:25.770 --> 00:37:27.300 line:0%
which became an obsession.

00:37:27.760 --> 00:37:29.220 line:0%
Yet she's torn between love and hate,

00:37:29.220 --> 00:37:30.520 line:0%
unable to let go.

00:37:33.280 --> 00:37:34.610 line:0%
It's quite lamentable.

00:37:35.610 --> 00:37:36.600 line:0%
To lose oneself entirely

00:37:36.600 --> 00:37:38.130 line:0%
in a romantic relationship

00:37:38.720 --> 00:37:40.520 line:0%
is the behavior of a fool.

00:37:41.080 --> 00:37:42.200 line:0%
And in this world,

00:37:42.680 --> 00:37:43.920 line:0%
fools often do evil.

00:37:44.320 --> 00:37:45.680 line:0%
What's there to lament?

00:37:48.400 --> 00:37:49.200 line:0%
Yeah.

00:37:49.800 --> 00:37:51.720 line:0%
That sounds like something a smart person like you

00:37:51.720 --> 00:37:52.880 line:0%
would say.

00:37:53.440 --> 00:37:54.260 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:37:54.260 --> 00:37:55.440 line:0%
I'm tired.

00:37:55.560 --> 00:37:56.960 line:0%
I need to rest for a while.

00:38:02.360 --> 00:38:03.760 line:0%
Prince Xian has successfully completed

00:38:03.760 --> 00:38:05.120 line:0%
the disaster relief efforts.

00:38:05.120 --> 00:38:05.760 line:0%
He will soon

00:38:05.760 --> 00:38:07.290 line:0%
arrive safely in Xiang'an.

00:38:07.680 --> 00:38:09.040 line:0%
That's good news.

00:38:13.400 --> 00:38:14.200 line:0%
From now on,

00:38:15.530 --> 00:38:18.190 line:0%
you don't need to linger around the pigeon coop.

00:38:23.250 --> 00:38:25.840 line:0%
I don't know who gave you the false information,

00:38:25.840 --> 00:38:28.740 line:0%
but the Imperial Security Bureau's secret messages

00:38:28.740 --> 00:38:30.870 line:0%
are not delivered by carrier pigeons.

00:38:32.240 --> 00:38:33.720 line:0%
I know that.

00:38:35.270 --> 00:38:38.190 line:0%
The pigeons in that coop are all soft-feathered

00:38:38.370 --> 00:38:40.170 line:0%
and can't fly long distances.

00:38:42.860 --> 00:38:44.520 line:0%
But I still have to wander

00:38:44.520 --> 00:38:46.320 line:0%
in the mansion from time to time.

00:38:47.320 --> 00:38:49.140 line:0%
You have your duties to attend to,

00:38:49.140 --> 00:38:50.970 line:0%
and I have my tasks to accomplish.

00:38:50.970 --> 00:38:52.390 line:0%
I have to keep up appearances, after all.

00:38:52.390 --> 00:38:53.620 line:0%
But nothing serious will come of it.

00:38:53.620 --> 00:38:54.500 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:38:58.170 --> 00:39:00.430 line:0%
Now you can believe even the fiercest tiger

00:39:00.430 --> 00:39:01.960 line:0%
wouldn't harm its own cubs,

00:39:02.400 --> 00:39:03.640 line:0%
let alone the most powerful tiger

00:39:03.640 --> 00:39:04.960 line:0%
in the world, right?

00:39:05.040 --> 00:39:05.970 line:0%
Stop.

00:39:06.080 --> 00:39:06.960 line:0%
I don't want to hear it.

00:39:06.960 --> 00:39:08.680 line:0%
I won't listen to what I shouldn't.

00:39:08.680 --> 00:39:10.740 line:0%
I don't want to get myself in trouble.

00:39:14.040 --> 00:39:14.840 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:16.040 line:0%
There's one small thing

00:39:16.040 --> 00:39:17.170 line:0%
I forgot to tell you.

00:39:17.200 --> 00:39:18.200 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice and constables

00:39:18.200 --> 00:39:19.160 line:0%
will hold a celebration banquet.

00:39:19.160 --> 00:39:20.240 line:0%
They sent an invitation,

00:39:20.240 --> 00:39:21.900 line:0%
inviting both of us to attend.

00:39:23.940 --> 00:39:24.900 line:0%
-I know
-I…

00:39:25.360 --> 00:39:26.760 line:0%
you definitely won't go.

00:39:26.760 --> 00:39:28.240 line:0%
I'm just letting you know.

00:39:37.080 --> 00:39:37.880 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:39:38.080 --> 00:39:39.340 line:0%
Yes, Grand Commander.

00:39:41.460 --> 00:39:42.790 line:0%
Tell Uncle Zhong to make

00:39:42.920 --> 00:39:45.380 line:0%
a new set of those light-blocking curtains,

00:39:49.730 --> 00:39:51.330 line:0%
like the ones made last time.

00:39:51.900 --> 00:39:53.160 line:0%
Yes, Grand Commander.

00:40:16.370 --> 00:40:18.150 line:0%
What a lovely flower bud.

00:40:18.460 --> 00:40:19.340 line:0%
What a pity.

00:40:22.640 --> 00:40:23.520 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:40:24.640 --> 00:40:25.440 line:0%
Mentor.

00:40:25.680 --> 00:40:27.200 line:0%
Your efforts in disaster relief and pacifying the people

00:40:27.200 --> 00:40:28.520 line:0%
have been truly commendable.

00:40:28.520 --> 00:40:30.340 line:0%
I heard the grand empress dowager

00:40:30.340 --> 00:40:32.990 line:0%
will greatly reward you for this journey.

00:40:33.360 --> 00:40:35.840 line:0%
Was the journey back peaceful?

00:40:41.830 --> 00:40:43.090 line:0%
Rest assured, Mentor.

00:40:43.560 --> 00:40:45.380 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau escorted me the entire way.

00:40:45.380 --> 00:40:47.040 line:0%
Everything was taken care of.

00:40:48.200 --> 00:40:48.920 line:0%
This time,

00:40:48.920 --> 00:40:50.920 line:0%
I brought back some local specialties.

00:40:50.920 --> 00:40:51.800 line:0%
Prepare a portion

00:40:51.800 --> 00:40:53.260 line:0%
for my mentor to take home.

00:40:56.120 --> 00:40:57.300 line:0%
Prepare another portion

00:40:57.300 --> 00:40:58.640 line:0%
and deliver it to my sister.

00:40:58.640 --> 00:40:59.360 line:0%
Tell her

00:40:59.380 --> 00:41:00.440 line:0%
it's a gesture

00:41:00.440 --> 00:41:02.040 line:0%
from her younger brother.

00:41:02.560 --> 00:41:03.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:41:05.640 --> 00:41:06.920 line:0%
Your Highness, your kindness

00:41:06.920 --> 00:41:08.120 line:0%
and deep family bond

00:41:08.270 --> 00:41:10.760 line:0%
are truly touching.

00:41:11.240 --> 00:41:13.680 line:0%
However, recently, Princess Ying

00:41:13.700 --> 00:41:16.000 line:0%
has been implicated in Mrs. Tang's case.

00:41:16.520 --> 00:41:18.850 line:0%
I'm afraid she's going to have a hard time.

00:41:22.200 --> 00:41:23.320 line:0%
I heard about this

00:41:23.320 --> 00:41:24.600 line:0%
during my journey.

00:41:25.400 --> 00:41:26.200 line:0%
My sister has always been

00:41:26.200 --> 00:41:27.440 line:0%
on good terms with Mrs. Tang.

00:41:27.440 --> 00:41:29.240 line:0%
And they both support scholars from humble backgrounds.

00:41:29.240 --> 00:41:31.000 line:0%
But the public opinion right now

00:41:31.000 --> 00:41:32.640 line:0%
is very unfavorable to them.

00:41:33.880 --> 00:41:35.030 line:0%
Indeed.

00:41:35.360 --> 00:41:37.000 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:41:37.480 --> 00:41:38.520 line:0%
that in Mrs. Tang's case,

00:41:38.520 --> 00:41:39.840 line:0%
the Yan family's Yan Xing

00:41:39.840 --> 00:41:41.440 line:0%
has made a great contribution.

00:41:41.440 --> 00:41:43.320 line:0%
Who would have thought this daughter of a concubine,

00:41:43.320 --> 00:41:45.080 line:0%
who usually shies away from everything,

00:41:45.080 --> 00:41:46.480 line:0%
would prove so resourceful

00:41:46.480 --> 00:41:48.320 line:0%
at that critical moment?

00:41:53.960 --> 00:41:54.760 line:0%
Prince Xian,

00:41:54.930 --> 00:41:57.280 line:0%
do you think Yan Xing

00:41:57.640 --> 00:41:58.800 line:0%
can...

00:42:00.480 --> 00:42:01.800 line:0%
Mentor, if you value her,

00:42:01.800 --> 00:42:02.860 line:0%
she must be worthy.

00:42:04.200 --> 00:42:05.320 line:0%
Perhaps

00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:08.880 line:0%
she truly is the key

00:42:10.120 --> 00:42:11.960 line:0%
to breaking the stalemate.

00:42:13.640 --> 00:42:15.000 line:0%
These flowers need fertilizing.

00:42:15.000 --> 00:42:16.360 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:42:19.320 --> 00:42:20.180 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:42:20.640 --> 00:42:21.880 line:0%
it seems

00:42:22.040 --> 00:42:23.800 line:0%
many of the noble ladies are claiming to be ill

00:42:23.800 --> 00:42:25.930 line:0%
and won't attend this flower banquet.

00:42:27.720 --> 00:42:28.600 line:0%
Got it.

00:42:30.800 --> 00:42:32.330 line:0%
Those who don't want to come

00:42:34.560 --> 00:42:36.820 line:0%
don't need to come anymore in the future.

00:42:40.570 --> 00:42:42.890 line:0%
They can't be people I can make use of.